stream
BT /F2 16 Tf 54 723 Td (Disciplinary and Grievance Procedure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Policy code: POL-HR-040. Owner: Chief People Officer. Effective date: 1 September 2024.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 688 Td (Version: 1.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 663 Td (1. Purpose and scope) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 641 Td (This procedure explains how Meridian Instruments Ltd deals with concerns about an employee's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628 Td (conduct and how employees can raise a grievance about their work. It aims to resolve issues) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (fairly, consistently and as early as possible. It applies to all employees at all sites. Where) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 602 Td (local law in the Netherlands, the United States or Malaysia requires a different process, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 589 Td (local People team will apply the procedure with any necessary adjustments and will explain them) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 576 Td (to the employee in writing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 554 Td (This procedure does not apply to performance concerns during probation, which are handled under) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 541 Td (the Probation Policy \(POL-HR-011\), or to concerns about wrongdoing in the business, which) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 528 Td (should be raised under the Speak Up Policy \(POL-CORP-004\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 503 Td (2. Principles) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 481 Td (- Issues should be raised and dealt with promptly and without unreasonable delay.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 468 Td (- Meridian will investigate before taking any formal disciplinary action.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 455 Td (- Employees will be told the allegations against them and given the evidence before any) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 442 Td (   hearing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 429 Td (- Employees have the right to be accompanied at formal meetings by a colleague or a trade) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 416 Td (   union representative.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 403 Td (- No disciplinary action beyond an informal discussion will be taken until the case has been) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 390 Td (   fully investigated.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 377 Td (- Employees have the right to appeal against any formal outcome.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 364 Td (- Records are kept confidential and held in Keel in line with the Records Retention Schedule) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 351 Td (   \(POL-CORP-008\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 335 Td (3. Informal resolution) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 313 Td (Many minor conduct issues, such as occasional lateness or a lapse in following a procedure, can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 300 Td (be resolved by an informal conversation between the employee and their line manager. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 287 Td (manager should explain the concern, listen to the employee's explanation, agree what needs to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 274 Td (change and by when, and keep a brief note in Keel. An informal discussion is not a disciplinary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 261 Td (sanction and is not recorded as a warning.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 236 Td (4. Investigation and suspension) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 214 Td (Where the matter is more serious or informal action has not worked, the manager must contact) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 201 Td (the People team at peoplehelp@meridian-instruments.example before taking further action. An) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 188 Td (investigating officer, who will not be the person who decides the outcome, will gather facts,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 175 Td (which may include interviewing the employee and witnesses and reviewing records.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 153 Td (In cases of alleged gross misconduct, or where an investigation could be compromised, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 140 Td (employee may be suspended on full pay. Suspension is not a disciplinary sanction and does not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 127 Td (imply guilt. It will be kept as short as possible and reviewed at least every two weeks.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 102 Td (5. Disciplinary hearing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 80 Td (If the investigation shows there is a case to answer, the employee will be invited in writing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 67 Td (to a disciplinary hearing, with at least five working days' notice. The invitation will set out) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 54 Td (the allegations, include the investigation report and evidence, state the possible outcomes and) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
