6 0 obj
<< /Length 4114 >>
stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (confirm the right to be accompanied.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 707 Td (If the chosen companion is unavailable, the employee may propose another date within five) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 694 Td (working days of the original. At the hearing the employee can respond to the allegations,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 681 Td (present evidence and call relevant witnesses. The outcome will be confirmed in writing,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 668 Td (normally within five working days of the hearing.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 643 Td (6. Disciplinary stages) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 621 Td (The stages below are normally followed in order, but Meridian may start at a later stage) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 608 Td (depending on the seriousness of the conduct.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 587 Td (Stage | Typical use | Live period) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 575 Td (Informal discussion | minor first issue | not recorded as warning) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 563 Td (First written warning | misconduct or repeated minor issues | 6 months) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 551 Td (Final written warning | further or serious misconduct | 12 months) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 539 Td (Dismissal | further misconduct during a live final warning, or gross misconduct | n/a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 517 Td (A warning is live for the period shown from the date of the outcome letter. After it expires it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 504 Td (is disregarded for future disciplinary purposes, although the record remains on file.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 482 Td (Alternatives to dismissal, such as demotion or transfer, may be considered at the final stage) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 469 Td (where appropriate and agreed.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 444 Td (7. Gross misconduct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 422 Td (Gross misconduct is conduct so serious that it may justify dismissal without notice for a first) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 409 Td (offence. Examples include:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 387 Td (- theft, fraud or deliberate falsification of records, including expense claims or product) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 374 Td (   test results;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 361 Td (- violence, bullying, harassment or discrimination;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 348 Td (- serious breaches of health and safety rules, including disabling gas detection equipment;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 335 Td (- being unfit for work through alcohol or drugs;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 322 Td (- serious breaches of the Code of Conduct \(POL-CORP-001\), including bribery;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 309 Td (- serious misuse of personal or confidential data;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 296 Td (- retaliation against someone who has spoken up.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 280 Td (8. Disciplinary appeals) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 258 Td (An employee may appeal against any formal outcome by writing to the People team within 5) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 245 Td (working days of receiving the outcome letter, stating the grounds of appeal. The appeal will be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 232 Td (heard, wherever possible, by a more senior manager who was not involved previously. The appeal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 219 Td (decision is final.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 194 Td (9. Raising a grievance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 172 Td (A grievance is a concern, problem or complaint that an employee raises about their work,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 159 Td (working environment or working relationships.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 137 Td (1. Where possible, raise the matter informally with your line manager first. If the grievance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 124 Td (   concerns your manager, raise it with their manager or the People team.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 111 Td (2. If informal resolution does not work, submit a formal grievance in writing to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 98 Td (   peoplehelp@meridian-instruments.example. A grievance should be raised within 3 months of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 85 Td (   the event it relates to, unless there is a good reason for delay.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 72 Td (3. A grievance meeting will be held within 10 working days of receiving the written) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 59 Td (   grievance. You have the right to be accompanied.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
