BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (4. The outcome will be confirmed in writing, normally within five working days of the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (   meeting.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 703 Td (5. If you are not satisfied, you may appeal within 5 working days of the outcome. The appeal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 690 Td (   will be heard by a manager not previously involved and the decision is final.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 674 Td (10. Overlapping disciplinary and grievance cases) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 652 Td (If an employee raises a grievance during a disciplinary process, the disciplinary process may) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 639 Td (be paused briefly to deal with the grievance, or both may be handled together where they are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 626 Td (related.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 601 Td (11. Support) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 579 Td (Formal processes can be stressful. Employees involved in a disciplinary or grievance process,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 566 Td (including witnesses, can use the Employee Assistance Programme for confidential support.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 553 Td (Managers can seek guidance at any time from the People team at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 540 Td (peoplehelp@meridian-instruments.example.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 515 Td (12. Review) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 493 Td (This procedure is reviewed every two years by the Chief People Officer, Adaeze Okafor.) Tj ET
endstream
